:: RobinTemple Clasp
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<set $RobinTemple.clasp_discussed to true>>
<!-- 罗宾线自行解释誓言与器具的关系，因此这里让约旦保持原版那种回避、克制的口吻。 -->
<<if $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin'>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_equipped>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin touches the clasp when you ask about it. "This one's from the temple," <<he>> says. "If I ever want it off, I have to ask <<nnpc_him 'Jordan'>>, not just take it off myself."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你问起贞操带，罗宾碰了碰扣锁。“这是神殿给我的，”<<he>>说，“如果我哪天想取下来，得去问<<nnpc_him 'Jordan'>>，不能自己摘。”
    <</language>>
  <<elseif C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus is ''
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina is ''
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis is ''>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin puts down the storeroom list. The temple fitting was destroyed when Jordan removed it. "Our promise still stands," <<he>> says, "whether I wear it or not."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾放下储藏室清单。神殿的器具已经在约旦拆除时毁掉了。“我们的承诺还在，”<<he>>说，“戴不戴它，都不会改变这件事。”
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin puts down the storeroom list. "This isn't the set Jordan fitted," <<he>> says. "I'd have to ask whoever put it on me."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾放下储藏室清单。“这一套不是约旦给我戴上的，”<<he>>说，“得去问给我戴上它的人。”
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<<elseif maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith gte 20>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin closes the storeroom list when you ask about the chastity belt. <<He>> does not want to leave the temple. <<He>> only wants to know whether <<he>> can put a promise into <<his>> own words, belt or no belt.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你问起贞操带，罗宾合上储藏室清单。<<He>>并不想离开神殿，只想知道除了这件器具之外，能不能用自己的话再立一次承诺。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin closes the storeroom list. "I still need time to decide what I believe," <<he>> says. "I like the quiet here. I'm not ready to promise my whole life to it yet."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾合上储藏室清单。“我还得想清楚自己相信什么，”<<he>>说，“我喜欢这里的安静，可还没准备好把一生都许给它。”
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').member>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_request isnot ''>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin remembers your earlier conversation. "I want to tell Jordan myself," <<he>> says. "Will you come with me?"
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾记得你们先前的谈话。“我想亲口告诉约旦，”<<he>>说，“你陪我一起去，好吗？”
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').claspReady>>
      <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_request is 'remove'>>
        <<lockicon 'unlock'>><<lanLink ['Accompany Robin to Jordan for removal (0:15)', '陪罗宾找约旦拆除贞操带 (0:15)'] 'RobinTemple Clasp Result'>><</lanLink>><br>
      <<else>>
        <<lockicon>><<lanLink ['Accompany Robin to Jordan for refitting (0:05)', '陪罗宾找约旦重新戴好贞操带 (0:05)'] 'RobinTemple Clasp Result'>><</lanLink>><br>
      <</if>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <span class='teal'>Return together during daylight, when Jordan is available outside Sunday mass.</span>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <span class='teal'>白天约旦在场、没有主持周日弥撒时，再一起去找约旦。</span>
      <</language>><br>
    <</if>>
  <<elseif $RobinTemple.clasp_equipped
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus is 'anal shield'
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina is 'chastity belt'
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis is 'chastity belt'>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').claspFee gt 0>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <span class='teal'>Without a promise, Jordan asks for an £80 donation to remove a virgin's temple fitting. Removing it does not release Robin from the vow.</span>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <span class='teal'>尚未承诺、仍保有初次贞洁时，约旦要求捐赠 £80 才会拆除神殿器具。取下它不代表罗宾可以违背誓言。</span>
      <</language>><br><br>
    <</if>>
    <<if $money gte maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').claspFee>>
      <<lockicon 'unlock'>><<lanLink ['Ask if Robin wants the chastity lock removed (0:15)', '问罗宾是否想取下贞操带 (0:15)'] 'RobinTemple Clasp Request'>>
        <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_request is '' and $RobinTemple.clasp_equipped
          and C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus is 'anal shield'
          and C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina is 'chastity belt'
          and C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis is 'chastity belt'
          and $money gte maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').claspFee>>
          <<money `-maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').claspFee`>>
          <<set $RobinTemple.clasp_request to 'remove'>>
          <<pass 15>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <<else>>
      <<language>><<option 'EN'>><span class='red'>You do not have the donation in cash.</span><<option 'CN'>><span class='red'>你没有足够的现金支付这笔捐赠。</span><</language>><br>
    <</if>>
  <<elseif !$RobinTemple.clasp_equipped
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus is ''
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina is ''
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis is ''>>
    <<lockicon>><<lanLink ['Ask if Robin wants the chastity lock put back on (0:15)', '问罗宾是否想重新戴上贞操带 (0:15)'] 'RobinTemple Clasp Request'>>
      <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_request is '' and !$RobinTemple.clasp_equipped
        and C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus is ''
        and C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina is ''
        and C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis is ''>>
        <<set $RobinTemple.clasp_request to 'refit'>>
        <<pass 15>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin is wearing a different fitting. <<He>> will need to discuss that one with its owner before changing anything.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾身上是另一套装置。改动之前，<<he>>得先与那套装置的主人商量。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').publicPromise is ''>>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Ask Robin to speak to Jordan directly', '请罗宾亲自向约旦询问'] 'RobinTemple Clasp Jordan'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
<<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink ['Let Robin finish', '先听罗宾说完'] 'RobinTemple Clasp Listen'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Clasp Request
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').member
  and $RobinTemple.clasp_request isnot ''>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_request is 'remove'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Do you want to ask Jordan about taking the lock off?" you say. Robin looks down at the clasp, then nods. "I want to explain it myself," <<he>> says. "Will you come with me?"
        <<if $RobinTemple.templePromised isnot 'Robin'>><br><br>Robin takes the receipt for the arrangement. "I'm still keeping my vow," <<he>> says. "I want to tell Jordan that myself."<</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “你想不想去问约旦，能不能取下贞操带？”你问。罗宾低头看了看扣锁，点点头。“我想自己说明白，”<<he>>说，“你陪我一起去，好吗？”
        <<if $RobinTemple.templePromised isnot 'Robin'>><br><br>罗宾收好办理的凭条。“我还是会遵守誓言，”<<he>>说，“这句话，我想亲口告诉约旦。”<</if>>
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You ask whether Robin wants to wear the chastity belt again. <<He>> thinks for a moment. "I might," <<he>> says. "But I will speak to Jordan myself before deciding."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你问罗宾是否想重新戴上贞操带。<<He>>想了一会儿。“也许想，”<<he>>说，“但我会先亲自与约旦谈，再作决定。”
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').claspReady>>
    <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_request is 'remove'>>
      <<lockicon 'unlock'>><<lanLink ['Accompany Robin to Jordan for removal (0:15)', '陪罗宾找约旦拆除贞操带 (0:15)'] 'RobinTemple Clasp Result'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<else>>
      <<lockicon>><<lanLink ['Accompany Robin to Jordan for refitting (0:05)', '陪罗宾找约旦重新戴好贞操带 (0:05)'] 'RobinTemple Clasp Result'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "We'll have to wait until Jordan is free," Robin says. <span class='teal'>Come back together during daylight, outside Sunday mass.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “得等约旦有空才行，”罗宾说。<span class='teal'>白天约旦在场、没有主持周日弥撒时，再一起回来。</span>
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is nothing to arrange right now.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      现在没有需要商量的事。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon 'temple/robin-quarters.png'>><<lanLink ['Return to Robin\'s place', '回到罗宾的座位'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Clasp Result
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').claspReady and $RobinTemple.clasp_request isnot ''>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_request is 'remove'
    and $RobinTemple.clasp_equipped
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus is 'anal shield'
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina is 'chastity belt'
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis is 'chastity belt'>>
    <<set C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus to ''>>
    <<set C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina to ''>>
    <<set C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis to ''>>
    <<set $RobinTemple.clasp_equipped to false>>
    <<pass 15>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin leads you to the side room. Jordan checks the earlier request, then asks Robin if <<he>> is certain. <<if $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin'>>Robin glances at your matching rings before nodding. "We still mean our promise."<<else>>Robin nods, keeping hold of your hand. "I know my vow still stands."<</if>>
        <br><br>
        Jordan fetches a sinister-looking blade and takes Robin inside. You wait in the corridor while the fittings are removed. A few members pass on their way to the hall before the door opens again.
        <br><br>
        Robin steps out, straightening <<his>> clothes. "That tool looked a bit frightening," <<he>> admits. <<He>> reaches for your hand again. <<if $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin'>>"But I still meant what I said when we made our vows."<<else>>"Thank you for waiting."<</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾带你来到侧室门口。约旦核对先前的申请，又问罗宾是不是想好了。<<if $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin'>>罗宾看了看你们手上的戒指，点点头。“我们立下的承诺还是算数的。”<<else>>罗宾牵着你的手，点点头。“我知道，入教时的誓言还在。”<</if>>
        <br><br>
        约旦拿来阴森的刀片，领罗宾进了侧室。你留在走廊等候，几名成员从你身旁走向大厅。等门再次打开时，器具已经拆除了。
        <br><br>
        罗宾走出来，理了理衣服。“那个工具看着有点吓人，”<<he>>承认，又伸手牵住你。<<if $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin'>>“不过，立誓时说的话，我还是认真的。”<<else>>“谢谢你等我。”<</if>>
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <span class='green'>Jordan has removed Robin's temple chastity belt and anal shield.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <span class='green'>约旦已拆除罗宾的神殿贞操带与护肛板。</span>
    <</language>>
  <<elseif $RobinTemple.clasp_request is 'refit'
    and !$RobinTemple.clasp_equipped
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus is ''
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina is ''
    and C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis is ''>>
    <<set C.npc.Robin.chastity.anus to 'anal shield'>>
    <<set C.npc.Robin.chastity.vagina to 'chastity belt'>>
    <<set C.npc.Robin.chastity.penis to 'chastity belt'>>
    <<set $RobinTemple.clasp_equipped to true>>
    <<pass 5>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You accompany Robin to the side room. Jordan checks the request and asks if <<he>> still wants the fittings. Robin nods. "I'd like to wear them again."
        <br><br>
        Jordan brings a new set and takes Robin inside. You wait in the corridor while the fittings are secured and checked. When Robin returns, <<he>> takes a few careful steps before relaxing.
        <br><br>
        "It feels all right," <<he>> says, taking your hand. "Jordan reminded me that <<if $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin'>>our vows<<else>>my vow<</if>> still <<if $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin'>>count<<else>>counts<</if>>, with or without it." Together, you head back to the work list.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你陪罗宾来到侧室。约旦核对申请，问<<he>>是否仍然想戴上器具。罗宾点点头。“我想重新戴好。”
        <br><br>
        约旦拿来一套新的器具，领罗宾进去。你在走廊等候，约旦为<<he>>戴好后又检查了一遍。罗宾出来时小心地走了几步，才放松下来。
        <br><br>
        “没有不舒服，”<<he>>说，牵住你的手。“约旦提醒我，戴不戴都得遵守<<if $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin'>>我们的誓言<<else>>入教时的誓言<</if>>。”你们一起回到工作表前。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <span class='green'>Jordan has refitted Robin's temple chastity belt and anal shield.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <span class='green'>约旦已为罗宾重新戴好神殿贞操带与护肛板。</span>
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The clasp Jordan fitted is no longer the one Robin is wearing. Robin agrees to bring it up with <<nnpc_him 'Jordan'>> another day.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾身上已不是约旦当初戴上的那套。罗宾答应改天再去找<<nnpc_him 'Jordan'>>说明。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.clasp_request to ''>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_request isnot ''>>Robin keeps the arrangements in mind. You will need to return together during daylight, when Jordan is free outside Sunday mass.<<else>>There is nothing to arrange right now.<</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_request isnot ''>>罗宾还记着这件事。得等白天约旦在场、没有主持周日弥撒时，你们再一起回来。<<else>>现在没有需要办理的事。<</if>>
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon 'temple/robin-quarters.png'>><<lanLink ['Return to Robin\'s place', '回到罗宾的座位'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Clasp Jordan
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Jordan listens to your question. "We don't use keys," Jordan says. "Removing the temple's fitting requires specialised equipment. Before I consider an exception, I need to know how you intend to honour your vows."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    约旦听了你们的问题。“我们不用钥匙，”约旦说，“取下神殿的器具需要专门的工具。在考虑破例之前，我得知道你们打算怎样遵守誓言。”
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40 or C.npc.Robin.dom lte 50>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin glances at you before speaking. "Could we… make a promise together?" <<he>> asks. <<His>> fingers close around yours while Jordan asks to see your work records.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾先看了你一眼。“我们能不能……一起立誓？”<<he>>问。约旦提出查看你们的工作记录时，<<his>>手指握住了你的手。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "What if we made a promise together?" Robin asks. Jordan asks to see your work records before giving an answer. Robin nods, then looks at you to see what you think.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “如果我们共同立誓呢？”罗宾问。约旦想先看你们的工作记录，再作回答。罗宾点点头，随后望向你，想知道你的意思。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<set maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith += 3>><<ggconviction 'Robin'>>
<<npcincr Robin dom 1>><<gdom>><br><br>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink ['Talk about a shared vow', '谈谈共同立誓'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<icon 'temple/robin-quarters.png'>><<lanLink ['Return to Robin\'s place', '回到罗宾的座位'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Clasp Listen
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You leave the list untouched and let Robin find <<his>> words. <<He>> tells you which parts of the work matter to <<him>>, and which rules still frighten <<him>>.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你没有碰那张清单，等罗宾自己把话说完。<<He>>告诉你，哪些工作对<<him>>重要，哪些规矩仍让<<him>>害怕。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40 or C.npc.Robin.dom lte 50>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "Could you come when I ask Jordan?" <<he>> says at last. "I think I'd feel better if you were there."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “我去问约旦的时候，你能陪我吗？”<<he>>最后说，“有你在，我会安心一点。”
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "I can ask Jordan myself," <<he>> says at last. "I just wanted you to know first."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “我能自己去问约旦，”<<he>>最后说，“只是想先告诉你。”
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<npcincr Robin love 2>><<npcincr Robin trauma -2>><<glove 'Robin'>><<lltrauma 'Robin'>><br><br>
<<icon 'temple/robin-quarters.png'>><<lanLink ['Return to Robin\'s place', '回到罗宾的座位'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>
